(7207415, 1109601, 113411, '<td valign="top">great focus and detail !!!</td>', 'great focus and detail !!!', '2014-04-23 14:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7207433, 1109559, 173844, '<td valign="top">This is so enjoyable!  The man is sound asleep, and probably snoring, in this quasi-home/work environment, with a hubbub of details strewn about.  The pair of clocks, about two minutes at odds, hang on the wall like sun and moon.  The woman in the picture above him, in her pose, is in curious synch with him.  Wires casually drape around the electrical warning labels.  The eye dances among all this detail, yet it''s pleasantly well-composed and harmoniously colored.  The bars pull the viewer back and force him or her to be an observer at a remove, like at a zoo.  It''s hyper-modern Norman Rockwell.  My favorite in the challenge and into my favorites it goes.</td>', 'This is so enjoyable!  The man is sound asleep, and probably snoring, in this quasi-home/work environment, with a hubbub of details strewn about.  The pair of clocks, about two minutes at odds, hang on the wall like sun and moon.  The woman in the picture above him, in her pose, is in curious synch with him.  Wires casually drape around the electrical warning labels.  The eye dances among all this detail, yet it''s pleasantly well-composed and harmoniously colored.  The bars pull the viewer back and force him or her to be an observer at a remove, like at a zoo.  It''s hyper-modern Norman Rockwell.  My favorite in the challenge and into my favorites it goes.', '2014-04-23 15:10:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7207449, 1109584, 173844, '<td valign="top">Excitingly complicated.  The lines weave together at all angles, softened by the clocks'' generous curves.  As a matter of fact, the choice to go black and white is almost forced by the need to enforce some order on this intricate Rube Goldbergesque scene.  What intrigues me the most is the notion that the clock faces are eyes and the machinery the brain at work.  A real treat.</td>', 'Excitingly complicated.  The lines weave together at all angles, softened by the clocks'' generous curves.  As a matter of fact, the choice to go black and white is almost forced by the need to enforce some order on this intricate Rube Goldbergesque scene.  What intrigues me the most is the notion that the clock faces are eyes and the machinery the brain at work.  A real treat.', '2014-04-23 15:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7207456, 1109638, 173844, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully playful and creative.  Simple yet enchanting, with profound philosophical overtones.  I love the bright colors and the way the shadow cast by a push pin forms a clock hand.  Here''s an interesting mind at work.</td>', 'Wonderfully playful and creative.  Simple yet enchanting, with profound philosophical overtones.  I love the bright colors and the way the shadow cast by a push pin forms a clock hand.  Here''s an interesting mind at work.', '2014-04-23 15:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7207463, 1109540, 173844, '<td valign="top">A magical and whimsical piece of architecture that revels in its symmetry.  The sepia coloration is attractive.  The portrayal of clouds behind the tower is excellent.  Shift your focus and the central area morphs into a strange face, like an automaton.  Appealing, interesting and satisfying.</td>', 'A magical and whimsical piece of architecture that revels in its symmetry.  The sepia coloration is attractive.  The portrayal of clouds behind the tower is excellent.  Shift your focus and the central area morphs into a strange face, like an automaton.  Appealing, interesting and satisfying.', '2014-04-23 15:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7207466, 1109624, 173844, '<td valign="top">There''s a nice silky glow to this deceivingly simple still life.  The textures are understated but attractive.  What I really like about the composition is how the shadow, watch and chain loop across the wood surface.  That the watch face is cracked and the second hand is missing adds to the feeling of timelessness.</td>', 'There''s a nice silky glow to this deceivingly simple still life.  The textures are understated but attractive.  What I really like about the composition is how the shadow, watch and chain loop across the wood surface.  That the watch face is cracked and the second hand is missing adds to the feeling of timelessness.', '2014-04-23 15:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7207467, 1109519, 173844, '<td valign="top">I like the simple but balanced composition and the looming perspective here.  With sundials the procession of time is palpable, which is only exaggerated by the up-closeness of the image and the fine granulation of the concrete base. Nice and clean.</td>', 'I like the simple but balanced composition and the looming perspective here.  With sundials the procession of time is palpable, which is only exaggerated by the up-closeness of the image and the fine granulation of the concrete base. Nice and clean.', '2014-04-23 16:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7207478, 1109555, 173844, '<td valign="top">A very interesting and creative image.  Because I can''t read the man''s expression I''m left a bit confused --  but in a good way.  Without the excellent title I wonder what I would have made of it.  The stark presentation invites the viewer to engage in its meaning.  It certainly engages me and I appreciate it.</td>', 'A very interesting and creative image.  Because I can''t read the man''s expression I''m left a bit confused --  but in a good way.  Without the excellent title I wonder what I would have made of it.  The stark presentation invites the viewer to engage in its meaning.  It certainly engages me and I appreciate it.', '2014-04-23 16:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7207480, 1109065, 173844, '<td valign="top">A very pretty image.  Beautiful golds and blues. And the half and half horizon works for me, even as the tower hits a third of the way in. Dreamy time of day.  I''m nitpicking here, but the white bit on the ocean horizon is somewhat distracting.  Overall, though, this is quite pleasing.</td>', 'A very pretty image.  Beautiful golds and blues. And the half and half horizon works for me, even as the tower hits a third of the way in. Dreamy time of day.  I''m nitpicking here, but the white bit on the ocean horizon is somewhat distracting.  Overall, though, this is quite pleasing.', '2014-04-23 16:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7207484, 1109057, 173844, '<td valign="top">This clock has a curiously stable presence in conjunction with the entirety of the composition.  The eye keeps coming back to the unusual clock, stolid and self-assured.  It resembles a flower or a gingerbread man.  Decorous and good company (the image, that is).</td>', 'This clock has a curiously stable presence in conjunction with the entirety of the composition.  The eye keeps coming back to the unusual clock, stolid and self-assured.  It resembles a flower or a gingerbread man.  Decorous and good company (the image, that is).', '2014-04-23 16:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7207492, 1109585, 173844, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is a new one on me.  Adds visual meaning to the idea of time''s passage, slipping away, evaporating.  Nice old-fashioned feel, perhaps belied by the cars, but appealing nevertheless.  The echoing streetlights are a good touch.</td>', 'Wow, this is a new one on me.  Adds visual meaning to the idea of time''s passage, slipping away, evaporating.  Nice old-fashioned feel, perhaps belied by the cars, but appealing nevertheless.  The echoing streetlights are a good touch.', '2014-04-23 16:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7207505, 1109592, 173844, '<td valign="top">I really like this imaginative entry.  The depth of field is impeccable and the background blur nicely composed.  One is invited to imagine the whimsical ramifications of this timepiece as the wind blows and new dandelions proliferate.  Sweet and creative.</td>', 'I really like this imaginative entry.  The depth of field is impeccable and the background blur nicely composed.  One is invited to imagine the whimsical ramifications of this timepiece as the wind blows and new dandelions proliferate.  Sweet and creative.', '2014-04-23 16:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7207753, 1109049, 24454, '<td valign="top">I''m finding as I vote that it''s hard to make clocks and watches interesting as far as photography goes, but I think you have accomplished that very nicely!</td>', 'I''m finding as I vote that it''s hard to make clocks and watches interesting as far as photography goes, but I think you have accomplished that very nicely!', '2014-04-24 01:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7207755, 1109540, 24454, '<td valign="top">Yes!  A clock in the context of a story to create artistry around it.  My favorite so far!</td>', 'Yes!  A clock in the context of a story to create artistry around it.  My favorite so far!', '2014-04-24 01:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7207792, 1109136, 52854, '<td valign="top">Nice - Crazy how much cool stuff goes on in there :)</td>', 'Nice - Crazy how much cool stuff goes on in there :)', '2014-04-24 04:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7207841, 1109527, 173844, '<td valign="top">I like how this enormous clock is humanized by the people on the scaffold.  The clock itself is sharply picked out by its own shadows, as are the recesses of the building.  I like the blankness of the sky and the choice of tone.  Overall, it has a fine historical feel.</td>', 'I like how this enormous clock is humanized by the people on the scaffold.  The clock itself is sharply picked out by its own shadows, as are the recesses of the building.  I like the blankness of the sky and the choice of tone.  Overall, it has a fine historical feel.', '2014-04-24 10:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7207842, 1109587, 173844, '<td valign="top">Nice depth of field.  I like how the chain transitions from links to bokeh.</td>', 'Nice depth of field.  I like how the chain transitions from links to bokeh.', '2014-04-24 10:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7207843, 1109632, 173844, '<td valign="top">Cool framing and inclusion of the red eclipsing moon marked in time by the tower clock.</td>', 'Cool framing and inclusion of the red eclipsing moon marked in time by the tower clock.', '2014-04-24 10:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7207844, 1109552, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lively, colorful and well-composed.</td>', 'Lively, colorful and well-composed.', '2014-04-24 11:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7207845, 1109550, 173844, '<td valign="top">The clocks are well-integrated into this busy seeming but balanced image.</td>', 'The clocks are well-integrated into this busy seeming but balanced image.', '2014-04-24 11:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7207847, 1109613, 173844, '<td valign="top">Poignant tribute to your father.  There''s an appealing softness to all this metal which enhances the emotions.</td>', 'Poignant tribute to your father.  There''s an appealing softness to all this metal which enhances the emotions.', '2014-04-24 11:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7207849, 1109636, 173844, '<td valign="top">There''s a sense of accomplished stagecraft here, with strong lighting and choreography.  Another day begins and stories will unfold.</td>', 'There''s a sense of accomplished stagecraft here, with strong lighting and choreography.  Another day begins and stories will unfold.', '2014-04-24 11:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7207853, 1109428, 173844, '<td valign="top">Even more than the luscious colors I appreciate how the circles are both truncated in a way that endows equality to larger and smaller components of this composition.  The small size of the image is a disservice.</td>', 'Even more than the luscious colors I appreciate how the circles are both truncated in a way that endows equality to larger and smaller components of this composition.  The small size of the image is a disservice.', '2014-04-24 11:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7207854, 1109076, 173844, '<td valign="top">An organic clock processed in an interesting way to highlight the texture of the sawed off wood.</td>', 'An organic clock processed in an interesting way to highlight the texture of the sawed off wood.', '2014-04-24 11:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7207855, 1109637, 173844, '<td valign="top">Solid composition and bold choice of green clock face.</td>', 'Solid composition and bold choice of green clock face.', '2014-04-24 11:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7207861, 1109539, 173844, '<td valign="top">Very funny entry.  Black and white treatment lends a suitable starkness and threat to the situation, as do the saw teeth and the open pliers (?) in the background.</td>', 'Very funny entry.  Black and white treatment lends a suitable starkness and threat to the situation, as do the saw teeth and the open pliers (?) in the background.', '2014-04-24 11:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7207863, 1109572, 173844, '<td valign="top">A clever take on Dali''s iconic painting.  The heavy vignette seems appropriate.</td>', 'A clever take on Dali''s iconic painting.  The heavy vignette seems appropriate.', '2014-04-24 11:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7207865, 1109574, 173844, '<td valign="top">Well-posed and well-lit study.</td>', 'Well-posed and well-lit study.', '2014-04-24 11:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7207867, 1109136, 173844, '<td valign="top">Handsome and well-composed study. I like how the perimeters of the watch are clipped to fill the frame more fully.</td>', 'Handsome and well-composed study. I like how the perimeters of the watch are clipped to fill the frame more fully.', '2014-04-24 11:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7207868, 1109286, 173844, '<td valign="top">Interesting still life with a variety of textures.  The use of a black surround makes the cutting board appear to float.</td>', 'Interesting still life with a variety of textures.  The use of a black surround makes the cutting board appear to float.', '2014-04-24 11:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7207869, 1109475, 173844, '<td valign="top">Interesting close-up with great detail.</td>', 'Interesting close-up with great detail.', '2014-04-24 11:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7207874, 1109593, 173844, '<td valign="top">...which is notorious for its distortions, as time also is.  This image seems to be a philosophical enquiry and meditation.  The extreme graininess adds to the sense of uncertainty.</td>', '...which is notorious for its distortions, as time also is.  This image seems to be a philosophical enquiry and meditation.  The extreme graininess adds to the sense of uncertainty.', '2014-04-24 11:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7207875, 1109522, 173844, '<td valign="top">Pleasantly mysterious.  I like how the areas beneath the eyebrows are lit.  And that little star beneath the hourglass.</td>', 'Pleasantly mysterious.  I like how the areas beneath the eyebrows are lit.  And that little star beneath the hourglass.', '2014-04-24 12:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7207879, 1109611, 173844, '<td valign="top">I rated this image lower than the other sundial because it feels rather static.  Here is a completely subjective, and maybe gratuitous, suggestion:  the gnomon and its shadow are the most interesting elements here, looking like a bird, bat or stealth airplane; find an interesting composition featuring them.  Of course your own style is paramount, so please take this suggestion in the spirit it''s offered.</td>', 'I rated this image lower than the other sundial because it feels rather static.  Here is a completely subjective, and maybe gratuitous, suggestion:  the gnomon and its shadow are the most interesting elements here, looking like a bird, bat or stealth airplane; find an interesting composition featuring them.  Of course your own style is paramount, so please take this suggestion in the spirit it''s offered.', '2014-04-24 12:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7207880, 1109601, 173844, '<td valign="top">Strong and direct.</td>', 'Strong and direct.', '2014-04-24 12:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7207881, 1109564, 173844, '<td valign="top">Nice choice of background.</td>', 'Nice choice of background.', '2014-04-24 12:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7207894, 1109614, 144271, '<td valign="top">Beautiful clock face</td>', 'Beautiful clock face', '2014-04-24 13:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7207895, 1109527, 144271, '<td valign="top">I like the coloring</td>', 'I like the coloring', '2014-04-24 13:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7207913, 1109559, 50695, '<td valign="top">best in show<br/> <br/>I''m hanging this in my fantasy art gallery<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1077279" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg"/></a></td>', 'best in show I''m hanging this in my fantasy art gallery ', '2014-04-24 14:38:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7207927, 1109572, 152252, '<td valign="top">Beautiful reflection on time (pun intended). It makes the watch distorted- like the time sometimes becomes. Very nice.</td>', 'Beautiful reflection on time (pun intended). It makes the watch distorted- like the time sometimes becomes. Very nice.', '2014-04-24 14:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7207928, 1109636, 152252, '<td valign="top">One of my top choices. The light is amazing. Great shadows. Plus it really shows how the time is passing by. (voted earlier)</td>', 'One of my top choices. The light is amazing. Great shadows. Plus it really shows how the time is passing by. (voted earlier)', '2014-04-24 14:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7207930, 1109624, 152252, '<td valign="top">My top 3. Beautifully done. Love the pp</td>', 'My top 3. Beautifully done. Love the pp', '2014-04-24 14:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7207931, 1109638, 152252, '<td valign="top">Very cool approach. Definitely creative.</td>', 'Very cool approach. Definitely creative.', '2014-04-24 14:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7207932, 1109559, 152252, '<td valign="top">Great capture. Love it!</td>', 'Great capture. Love it!', '2014-04-24 14:57:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7207933, 1109637, 152252, '<td valign="top">This window and the light are really beautiful. I like it very much.</td>', 'This window and the light are really beautiful. I like it very much.', '2014-04-24 14:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7207987, 1109585, 159196, '<td valign="top">Ethereal &amp; lovely</td>', 'Ethereal & lovely', '2014-04-24 18:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7207990, 1109601, 159196, '<td valign="top">Cool title</td>', 'Cool title', '2014-04-24 18:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7207994, 1109614, 159196, '<td valign="top">A little sad, AND beautiful</td>', 'A little sad, AND beautiful', '2014-04-24 18:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7207995, 1109574, 159196, '<td valign="top">I love the shot, but feel that the clock is not the focal point</td>', 'I love the shot, but feel that the clock is not the focal point', '2014-04-24 18:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7207996, 1109592, 159196, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites! In my top 5</td>', 'One of my favorites! In my top 5', '2014-04-24 18:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
