(7208019, 1109540, 175219, '<td valign="top">Interesting but there is so much going on in this take the clocks kind of get lost. But very interesting.</td>', 'Interesting but there is so much going on in this take the clocks kind of get lost. But very interesting.', '2014-04-24 20:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
